---
/**
 * Places a table of contents exactly where the author writes it.
 *
 * No template emits this placeholder on its own any more: a page only gets a
 * table of contents if its content asks for one. Inside MDX content the
 * component is available without an import, because the page templates pass it
 * to the `Content` renderer via the `components` prop, e.g.
 *
 *   <TableOfContents />
 *
 * `src/middleware/toc.ts` replaces this placeholder at build time with the list
 * of the surrounding article's own `h2`–`h6` headings (the same generator as
 * before, now only triggered on request).
 */
---

<div data-toc />
